<!--
The control count, electrical allocation and two name-illumination outputs are
taken from Radio Times cabinet documentation.  No cabinet photograph is
currently available, so relative positions, exact button shades and the
position and appearance of the name panel are reconstructions based on the
closely related Cobra 3 cabinet style.  The documented answer colours are
A orange, B blue, C red and D green.  The two name-illumination outputs are
assumed to represent two lights behind the cabinet name panel; their physical
arrangement has not been confirmed.
-->
<mamelayout version="2">
